This license protects the innovation behind Advanced Sitemap while
encouraging open collaboration. The source code is public, free to use, and
open to contributions.

1. Free Use (Individuals, Education, and Companies)
You may use, run, study, and integrate Advanced Sitemap, including its
compiled versions, libraries, command-line tools, and language bindings,
free of charge, for personal, educational, and commercial purposes. This
includes use within a company, inside commercial websites, applications,
products or services, in CI pipelines, and in projects that generate
revenue. No fee, royalty, or registration is owed to Fordima for such use.

2. Fork, Modify, and Contribute
You may fork this repository, study the source code, and modify it. Forks are
authorized for the purpose of contributing improvements, bug fixes, new
features, or new language bindings back to the official project through a
Pull Request to the original repository. By submitting a contribution, you
agree that it is released under this same license and that Fordima Inc. may
integrate it into the official project.

3. Internal Integration
You may incorporate portions of this source code into your own systems,
applications, frameworks, or internal tools, and use them in your business,
provided that the result is not a product or service covered by Section 4.
You may write wrappers or bindings for your own use to call Advanced Sitemap
from another programming language or framework.

4. Restricted Use (Paid License Required)
A paid commercial license from Fordima Inc. is MANDATORY if you use this
source code, in whole or in part, to:
  a) Create, publish, or distribute an engine, library, tool, or service
     that is similar to, or competes with, Advanced Sitemap (for example, a
     sitemap generation, validation, optimization, or publication engine);
  b) Build a derivative product or a replacement based on this source code,
     including a port or rewrite of its logic in another language, whether
     open source or proprietary;
  c) Keep a private copy of this code in order to produce the same
     functionality or the same kind of product for your own commercial
     offering;
  d) Sell, redistribute, or sub-license the source code or a modified version
     of it as a standalone product, or integrate it directly into another
     commercial engine, library, or framework intended for sale;
  e) Offer a paid hosted, cloud, or "as a service" offering (such as a
     "Sitemap as a Service" platform) based on this source code.

5. Prohibition of Independent Forks
Maintaining a separate, permanent fork of this project in order to bypass the
authority of Fordima Inc., or to publish a competing package or binding on
any registry or marketplace (such as crates.io, npm, or PyPI), is strictly
prohibited.

6. Attribution
You must keep this license and the copyright notice with any copy of the
source code you use or redistribute.

